    "body": "fix on issue/1613-open-keeps-document · PR #1630 · pinned by refused_disk_project_keeps_document_and_history and refused_byte_project_keeps_document_and_history · merges when reviewed\n\nBoth pinning tests fail with the original implementations restored via cp (document content becomes empty), then pass after the fix is restored. All 10 file_pick_tests pass, including successful disk replacement and preference preservation. cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main passed: 868 tests passed, 6 ignored, zero failures.\n\nHead: eed04dfe4788fbc16043842358fff52ebb84dce4. Draft PR only; no merge or ready action. Interactive desktop/browser file pickers were not exercised; graphify update could not run because graphify is not installed.\n\nApproval requests raised: (1) git fetch upstream, because .git/FETCH_HEAD is sandbox read-only; (2) creating the requested branch/worktree, because it writes Git metadata; (3) completing git push -u local tracking updates, because the upload succeeded but the sandbox blocked .git/config and remote-ref updates. Verification/documentation subagents raised no approval prompts.\n",
